\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1.5583333333333333 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Arial\"\u003e현재\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Arial\"\u003e까지\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Arial\"\u003e 확인된 일부 현상 및 \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Arial\"\u003e수정\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Arial\"\u003e 현황에 대해 공\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Arial\"\u003e유 드립니다\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Arial\"\u003e.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1.5583333333333333 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Arial\"\u003e이슈\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Arial\"\u003e의\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan data-font-family=\"Arial\"\u003e수정 진행 \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Arial\"\u003e상황\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Arial\"\u003e은\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Arial\"\u003e 본 공지사항\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Arial\"\u003e에 업데이트하여\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Arial\"\u003e 안내\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Arial\"\u003e하여 드리겠습니다\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Arial\"\u003e.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1.5583333333333333 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Arial\"\u003e자세한 내용은 아래 내용을 확인해 \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Arial\"\u003e주시기 바랍니다\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Arial\"\u003e.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1.5583333333333333 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\" data-font-family=\"Arial\"\u003e[알려진 이슈 및 진행 현황]\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Arial\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1.5583333333333333 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt pap-left-indent-2em pap-hanging-indent-17pt\"\u003e\u003cspan id=\"SE-1753b833-368c-4f3a-8724-c2172825237b\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic se-weight-unset\" style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e● 아이템 콘솔 키트 II 사용 시 패키지는 소모되지만 콘솔 아이템이 정상적으로 지급되지 않는 현상이 확인되었습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp id=\"SE-6d74ac23-5980-4ac4-a5ce-af53677d074b\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-\"\u003e\u003cspan id=\"SE-093eadd6-3e21-484d-8531-fd7dcc8c00d4\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic se-weight-unset\" style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e└ 3월 업데이트에서 수정할 예정입니다. \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp id=\"SE-973ef449-0d2f-4535-8dd2-c2c843426a4e\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-\"\u003e\u003cspan id=\"SE-1056f32b-3d57-46ee-af33-b775207d806f\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic se-weight-unset\" style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e콘솔 키트 II 는 D-OUTSIDERS 출석 이벤트에서만 획득할 수 있습니다. 보유 중인 콘솔 키트 II 사용 후 아이템이 사라질 경우 고객센터에 문의해 주시길 바랍니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1.5583333333333333 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt pap-left-indent-2em pap-hanging-indent-17pt\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"\u003e● 모더니아가 오버로드 장비의 '명중률 증가' 효과를 보유 중일 시 스킬 2의 공격력 증가 효과가 적용되지 않는 현상(2월 20일 추가)\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"\u003e\u0026gt; 2월 22일 업데이트에서 수정되었습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1.5583333333333333 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt pap-left-indent-2em pap-hanging-indent-17pt\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"\u003e● 퀀시의 스킬 1과 버스트 스킬 오류(2월 20일 추가)\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"\u003e\u0026gt; 2월 22일 업데이트에서 수정되었습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1.5583333333333333 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt pap-left-indent-2em pap-hanging-indent-17pt\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"\u003e● 유니온 레이드에서 모더니아와 전투 시 메인 화면의 음악이 나오는 현상(2월 20일 추가)\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"\u003e\u0026gt; 2월 22일 업데이트에서 수정되었습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1.5583333333333333 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt pap-left-indent-2em pap-hanging-indent-17pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1.5583333333333333 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt pap-left-indent-17pt pap-hanging-indent-17pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Arial\"\u003e● \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Arial\"\u003e전투 중 모더니아의 사격 방향이 화면의 왼쪽으로 치우치는 현상이 \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Arial\"\u003e확인되었습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Arial\"\u003e\u0026nbsp; \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1.5583333333333333 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt pap-left-indent-2em pap-hanging-indent-17pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Arial\"\u003e\u0026gt; 2월 22일 업데이트\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Arial\"\u003e를 통해\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Arial\"\u003e 수정되었습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1.5583333333333333 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt pap-left-indent-2em pap-hanging-indent-17pt\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1.5583333333333333 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt pap-left-indent-17pt pap-hanging-indent-17pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Arial\"\u003e● 최대 장탄수 버프가 해제될 때 재장전 시 두번 장전되는 현상이 확인 되었\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Arial\"\u003e습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1.5583333333333333 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt pap-left-indent-2em pap-hanging-indent-17pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\" data-font-family=\"Arial\"\u003e\u0026gt; 2월 22일 업데이트를 통해 \u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"\u003e수정되었습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1.5583333333333333 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt pap-left-indent-2em pap-hanging-indent-17pt\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1.5583333333333333 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt pap-left-indent-17pt pap-hanging-indent-17pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Arial\"\u003e●\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan data-font-family=\"Arial\"\u003e 재장전 시 엄폐하지 않고 장전하여 피격되는 현상이 확인 되었습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1.5583333333333333 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt pap-left-indent-2em pap-hanging-indent-17pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\" data-font-family=\"Arial\"\u003e\u0026gt; 2월 22일 업데이트를 통해 \u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"\u003e수정되었습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1.5583333333333333 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt pap-left-indent-2em pap-hanging-indent-17pt\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1.5583333333333333 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt pap-left-indent-17pt pap-hanging-indent-17pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=