pan\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1.5583333333333333 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt pap-left-indent-2em pap-hanging-indent-17pt\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1.5583333333333333 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt pap-left-indent-17pt pap-hanging-indent-17pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Arial\"\u003e● \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Arial\"\u003e간헐적으로 유니온 채팅 기록이 정상적으로 보이지 않는 현상이 \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Arial\"\u003e확인되었습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1.5583333333333333 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt pap-left-indent-2em pap-hanging-indent-17pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Arial\"\u003e\u0026gt; 2월 22일 업데이트\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Arial\"\u003e를 통해\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Arial\"\u003e 수정되었습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1.5583333333333333 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt pap-left-indent-2em pap-hanging-indent-17pt\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1.5583333333333333 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt pap-left-indent-17pt pap-hanging-indent-17pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Arial\"\u003e● \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Arial\"\u003eBOSS [그레이브 디거]의 특수 공격(레드 서클)을 저지할 수 없는 현상이 \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-fami